      "content": "that doesnt feel beautiful though. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. i'm so tired of being \"who i need to be\" for everyone else. i just want the noise to stop. i want to be able to just... stop. like, actually stop. everything. i feel like there is no version of my life where i actually get to exist for myself.",
