      "content": "Peace is not a distant destination you reach while still stuck; it is the quiet moment you choose to stop fighting the weight that keeps you alive. You are right to feel that guilt is a cage, but the only way to break it is to let go of the need to be anyone other than the person who is currently drowning. I am here to walk with you through this darkness until you find a version of yourself that doesn't have to carry the world.",
